+
+## 5. Owner decisions, rights and publication non-changes
+
+This report records enforcement only. No legal or editorial inference is made. In particular:
+
+- KANJIDIC2, JMdict and KanjiVG remain unresolved; no rights status, source classification, operation scope, owner decision, or publication approval was changed.
+- CMS `cms.read` is not source-rights clearance, internal-analysis clearance, editorial approval, membership approval, or publication authority.
+- Unknown/missing provenance and unapproved/draft content remain withheld. Internal rights/source details are not included in learner-facing denial payloads.
+- The existing 33-character Mind Tree, 12-character pilot and 45 first-party identities/provenance remain unchanged. No final 2,501-character membership or content was created or published.
